        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack O'Connell, Sheridan Smith, Ralph Brown, Russell Tovey\n- Films: Tower Block, This Is England\n- Places: Derby, Nottingham\n- Organizations: Central Junior Television Workshop\n- Topics: acting career, film roles\n\nFacts:\n- Jack O'Connell was born and brought up in Derby.\n- Jack O'Connell trained in acting at the Central Junior Television Workshop in nearby Nottingham.\n- Jack O'Connell's training at the Central Junior Television Workshop led to roles in film, television, and theatre.\n- Jack O'Connell made his film debut as a teenaged skinhead in the coming-of-age drama This Is England in 2006.\n- Jack O'Connell's role in This Is England heralded his propensity for playing angry, troubled youth.\n- The film Tower Block stars Sheridan Smith, Jack O'Connell, Ralph Brown, and Russell Tovey.\n- Tower Block entails residents of a block of flats being targeted by an unseen sniper after witnessing the murder of a teenager.",
